# CubeXX (Allwinner H700/H616) stock gpio-keys-polled driver. The analog sticks
# are read by the stock ADC/amux driver and exposed on ANBERNIC-keys as
# ABS_Z/RX/RY/RZ (0x02/03/04/05), already centered and scaled to -4096..4096.
# Left stick = ABS_Z (horizontal) + ABS_RX (vertical).
# Right stick = ABS_RY (horizontal) + ABS_RZ (vertical).
# There is NO ABS_X/ABS_Y on CubeXX; do not use the RG34XXSP module axis layout.
# Digital codes per stock DTS: A=304 B=305 X=306 Y=307 L1=308 R1=309 SEL=310
# START=311 MODE=312 L3=313 L2=314 R2=315 R3=316 VOL-=114 VOL+=115.
# Lock-screen bring-up policy: physical A must be a direct confirm/unlock.
key 304 ENTER
key 305 BUTTON_B
key 306 BUTTON_X
key 307 BUTTON_Y
key 308 BUTTON_L1
key 309 BUTTON_R1
key 314 BUTTON_L2
key 315 BUTTON_R2
key 310 BUTTON_SELECT
key 311 BUTTON_START
key 312 BUTTON_MODE
key 313 BUTTON_THUMBL
key 316 BUTTON_THUMBR
key 114 VOLUME_DOWN
key 115 VOLUME_UP

# Menu's extra release-time 0x162 pulse is deliberately unmapped.
# BUTTON_MODE falls back to HOME; do not also dispatch the extra pulse.
# Android: left stick = AXIS_X/AXIS_Y, right stick = AXIS_Z/AXIS_RZ.
# Vertical axes may need "invert" if up/down is reversed on device.
axis 0x02 X
axis 0x03 Y
axis 0x04 Z
axis 0x05 RZ
axis 0x10 HAT_X
axis 0x11 HAT_Y